---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import heroImg from '../../assets/work/openbank-insurances/hero.png';
---

<Layout
  title="Openbank Insurances - Cristian Serrano"
  description="Case study: Openbank Insurances — UX and visual design work by Cristian Serrano for Openbank's insurance product offerings, via Globant."
>
  <header>
    <hgroup>
      <h1>Insurances</h1>
      <p>GLOBANT + OPENBANK · 2018</p>
    </hgroup>
    <figure class="wide">
      <Image src={heroImg} alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" />
    </figure>
  </header>

  <section id="summary">
    <article class="overview">
      <p>I joined Globant to become part of a large-scale digital products design and development multidisciplinary team. I've found myself working with Openbank, the 100% digital bank of the Santander Group. I was part of a group formed by hybrid (UX/UI) designers with focus on creating meaningful experiences on Insurance products, both for web and mobile platforms.</p>
    </article>

    <article id="basics">
      <dl class="facts">
        <div>
          <dt>Category</dt>
          <dd>B2C, Banking.</dd>
        </div>
        <div>
          <dt>Platforms</dt>
          <dd>Web, iOS, Android</dd>
        </div>
        <div>
          <dt>Role</dt>
          <dd>UX/UI Designer</dd>
        </div>
        <div>
          <dt>Time</dt>
          <dd>5 months</dd>
        </div>
      </dl>
    </article>
  </section>

  <hr>

  <section id="context">
    <h2>Case study in progress</h2>
  </section>

  <p class="end-mark" aria-hidden="true">◼︎</p>
</Layout>
